cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CDE-12 dataset — control-delivery evidence across ten systems"
abstract: >-
  Every cell of a CDE-12 application to ten systems at pinned revisions: two AI
  agent governance runtimes, six attestation and supply-chain specifications, and
  two author-controlled rows rated last (a format and a deployment using it, scored
  separately). One row per system and criterion, each carrying its verdict, evidence
  tier, evidence reference, supporting quote, rater and date. Released as data
  rather than summarised in prose so that individual cells can be contested.
  Single-rater, v0.1: no second-rater agreement has been computed, and the tier
  column shows unequal reading depth rather than hiding it.
type: dataset
message: >-
  If you use, correct or extend these measurements, cite this dataset. If you apply
  the criteria to a system of your own, cite the instrument instead — see
  ../CITATION.cff.
authors:
  - family-names: Abak
    given-names: Ali Toygar
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3718-4010"
